import{_ as t,o as i,c as n,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 272 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Female Cultivators' Situation: The Gender Blind Spot in Universal Benefit","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 272 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Female Cultivators' Situation: The Gender Blind Spot in Universal Benefit","no":272,"module":2,"tags":["Tang-Luo","Female Cultivators","Gender Blind Spot","Universal-Benefit Critique","Myriad-Realms Benchmark"],"related":["05-Myriad Races Common Progress Basic Program","51-Humanity Position and Traits","43-Education Guarantee Law"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0272_模块2-唐罗-女性修炼者处境.md","filePath":"en/0272_模块2-唐罗-女性修炼者处境.md"}`),a={name:"en/0272_模块2-唐罗-女性修炼者处境.md"};function s(r,e,l,u,d,h){return i(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-272-tang-luo-decomposition-female-cultivators-situation-the-gender-blind-spot-in-universal-benefit" tabindex="-1">Entry 272 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Female Cultivators&#39; Situation: The Gender Blind Spot in Universal Benefit <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-272-tang-luo-decomposition-female-cultivators-situation-the-gender-blind-spot-in-universal-benefit" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 272 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Female Cultivators&#39; Situation: The Gender Blind Spot in Universal Benefit&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Tang-Luo System (Entry 22)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-universal-benefit-covered-humanity-then-what" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Universal benefit covered humanity, then what <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-universal-benefit-covered-humanity-then-what" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Universal benefit covered humanity, then what&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the republican axiom of Myriad Races expressly states: human men and women, all beings, equal evolution qualification. Tang Luo&#39;s universal benefit wrote &quot;humanity,&quot; but left a blind spot at the &quot;human men and women&quot; tier. This entry takes the law-first axiom as core, dissecting female cultivators&#39; situation in the Tang-Luo system. Protagonist uniqueness dependency judgment: <strong>Tang Luo = high dependency / bestowal-style civilization</strong>. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Gender blind spot&#39;s energy-level waste:</p><ul><li><strong>Half the population idled</strong>: human women are half the population; their talent, comprehension, creativity are partially idled by traditional gender roles in the Tang-Luo system</li><li><strong>Mentor structure single</strong>: Wushuang Academy&#39;s high-tier mentors, core courses are male-dominated. Female disciples even if enrolled still lack same-sex role models and gender-adapted cultivation paths</li><li><strong>Prejudice hidden</strong>: on the surface &quot;both men and women may enroll,&quot; actually high-tier resources, inner-circle positions are still male-led. This hidden prejudice is harder to break than explicit bans</li></ul><p>Energy-level waste: <strong>half of humanity&#39;s cultivation talent is discounted.</strong> Tang Luo&#39;s universal benefit looks like it covers humanity, but effective coverage is only half of humanity.</p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Talent attrition</strong>: due to gender prejudice, the most talented batch of women is left in family, marriage, auxiliary roles. Civilization&#39;s talent pool is artificially cut in half</li><li><strong>Prejudice solidified</strong>: when Tang Luo is in office, society defaults to &quot;strong ones are mostly men.&quot; This default is sanctified by his prestige. Once he retires, prejudice rebounds, female cultivators&#39; situation is actually harder than pre-reform</li><li><strong>Knowledge lopsided</strong>: because women are long marginalized, the cultivation knowledge system lacks female-perspective iteration. Methods are optimized by male physiological and psychological traits; female cultivators get half the result with twice the effort</li></ol><p>Regression form: civilization looks gender-equal, actually quietly losing half its geniuses.</p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Blind spot is predation</strong>: Tang Luo is not deliberately oppressing women, but he never treated &quot;female cultivators&quot; as a group needing specialized design. This &quot;default neglect&quot; itself is structural predation</li><li><strong>Bestowal incomplete</strong>: he bestowed &quot;enrollment qualification,&quot; but did not bestow &quot;gender-adapted curricula,&quot; &quot;female mentor network,&quot; &quot;childbearing-period cultivation guarantee.&quot; Qualification is nominal, actual thresholds still there</li><li><strong>Good will&#39;s blind spot</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s good will radius drew to &quot;humanity,&quot; did not draw to &quot;women among human men and women.&quot; The blind spot is not ill will, but good will itself&#39;s shape is not round</li></ul><p>By the Gu Chensha / Tang Luo judgment table standard: Tang Luo = <strong>enlightened predator</strong>, the gender blind spot is one of his &quot;enlightenment&quot; boundaries — his good toward humanity still carries the gender default of his era.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Tang-Luo Gender Blind Spot</th><th>Anchor Symbiosis Gender Equality</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Nominal gender equality</td><td>Republican axiom of Myriad Races expressly: human men and women all equal</td></tr><tr><td>Curricula optimized by men</td><td>Female human cultivation paths separately compiled (Module 1 already has corresponding entries)</td></tr><tr><td>Mentor circle male-led</td><td>Cross-plane mentor network matches by talent, not gender</td></tr><tr><td>Childbearing period no guarantee</td><td>Symbiotic medical system + housing guarantee law backstop, childbearing and cultivation do not conflict</td></tr><tr><td>Hidden prejudice</td><td>Anchor Supervision Committee monitors gender ratios, unconstitutional = correction</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Alternative&#39;s crux: change &quot;nominal equality&quot; to &quot;structural equality&quot; — not only allowing women to cultivate, but doing specialized design for their special physiological, psychological, social situations.</p><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate Tang-Luo system, marking female cultivator proportion and success rate</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: Group A maintains status quo; Group B injects gender-adapted institutions</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: female high-tier cultivator proportion within a hundred years, total civilization energy</li><li><strong>Review expectation</strong>: Group B female high-tier cultivator proportion rises from single digits to 40%, total civilization energy rises about 30-40% — quantifying the &quot;gender-discrimination tax&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium</strong>. The Tang-Luo system&#39;s depiction of women is usually hidden prejudice, not explicit bans</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: medium</strong>. Long-form writing if it needs &quot;strong female&quot; characters to create话题, may temporarily give some female character a cheat; the early &quot;female cultivators rare&quot; setting is torn by plot</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency</strong>: high. Gender institution improvement depends entirely on Tang Luo&#39;s personal awareness</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: half of humanity&#39;s talent is discounted</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: blind spot is predation, good will&#39;s shape is not round enough</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s universal benefit stops at &quot;humanity,&quot; not refined to &quot;human men and women&quot;</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: this entry is an important dimension of the Myriad Races 99% coverage axiom</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: gender-adapted cultivation system is a necessary condition for civilization ascension</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Tang Luo&#39;s universal benefit is real universal benefit, but not round universal benefit. He drew a circle with &quot;humanity&quot; written inside, and outside the circle stands half of humanity. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s requirement: the circle must be drawn to &quot;human men and women, Youth Supremes, strange beasts, plant spirits, planet consciousness&quot; — not one missing.</p><p>In the final analysis, Tang-Luo · female cultivators&#39; situation described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./05-万族共进基本纲领.html">05-Myriad Races Common Progress Basic Program</a> · <a href="./51-人族定位与特质.html">51-Humanity Position and Traits</a> · <a href="./43-教育保障法.html">43-Education Guarantee Law</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const g=t(a,[["render",s]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
